<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About Amazon' }) %>
</head>
<body>

    <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <main class="page-main">
        <div class="feature-hero">
            <h1>About Amazon</h1>
            <p>Guided by four core principles: customer obsession rather than competitor focus, passion for invention, commitment to operational excellence, and long-term thinking.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="feature-section">
            <h2>Who We Are</h2>
            <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.7; color:#333; margin-bottom:20px;">
                Amazon is a company of builders who bring varying backgrounds, ideas, and points of view to inventing on behalf of our customers.
                From revolutionizing online shopping and package delivery to cloud computing with AWS and smart voice control with Alexa,
                we work tirelessly every day to make customers’ lives easier and better.
            </p>
        </section>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i></div>
                <h3>The Climate Pledge</h3>
                <p>Committed to reaching net-zero carbon emissions across our businesses by 2040, 10 years ahead of the Paris Agreement.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar"></i></div>
                <h3>Supporting Local Businesses</h3>
                <p>Empowering over 14 lakh Indian small and medium sellers, artisans, and women entrepreneurs to reach global shoppers.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i></div>
                <h3>Innovation &amp; Technology</h3>
                <p>Pioneering automated fulfillment robotics, AI computer vision, delivery drones, and clean energy data centers.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat"></i></div>
                <h3>Community Impact</h3>
                <p>Amazon Future Engineer programs bringing computer science education to underserved students across India.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="feature-section">
            <h2>Amazon by the Numbers</h2>
            <div class="step-grid">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num"><i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i></div>
                    <h4>300M+</h4>
                    <p>Active customer accounts worldwide</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck"></i></div>
                    <h4>100%</h4>
                    <p>Serviceable pincodes delivered across India</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num"><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i></div>
                    <h4>1.5M+</h4>
                    <p>Employees building the future globally</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i></div>
                    <h4>100%</h4>
                    <p>Renewable energy powering operations by 2025</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

    <script src="/js/common.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

